      "title": "File:2021 Quad-State Tornado Family track.png",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/2021_Quad-State_Tornado_Family_track.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
